# Count-lattice contraction map for six-party holographic facet 14

The larger-side regions fall into blocks of equal regions, so the contraction map factors through
the block popcounts: `facet14f = facet14G ∘ facet14blockPopcounts`.  `facet14G`
is a map on the finite count-lattice, 1-Lipschitz on lattice edges.  Kept in its own module so its
elaboration is paid once and cached as `.olean`.
-/

